@startuml 工作流状态机完整时序图（优化版）

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 50
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' 合并相关参与者，减少数量
participant "CommandEngine" as Engine
participant "WorkflowEventBus\n+ DelayQueue" as EventBus
participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker
participant "EventHandler\n+ StateFactory" as Handler
participant "WorkflowRunningStateAction" as RunningAction
participant "WorkflowExecutionGraph" as Graph
participant "TaskStateAction" as TaskAction
participant "GlobalTaskDispatchQueue\n+ Looper" as DispatchQueue
participant "TaskExecutorClient" as TaskClient
participant "Worker Server" as Worker
participant "Database" as DB

== 阶段1: 工作流启动 ==

Engine -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队
Engine --> Engine: 立即返回（异步）

note right of Engine: CommandEngine 扫描 Command\n创建工作流实例

== 阶段2: 事件轮询和处理 ==

loop 每100ms轮询
    FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
    EventBus --> FireWorker: WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent
    
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
    note right of Handler: WorkflowStartLifecycleEventHandler\n根据状态选择 StateAction
    
    Handler -> RunningAction: startEventAction(...)
    
    RunningAction -> Graph: getStartNodes()
    Graph --> RunningAction: 起始任务列表
    
    RunningAction -> Graph: isTriggerConditionMet()
    Graph --> RunningAction: true
    
    RunningAction -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)
    EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队
    
    RunningAction --> Handler: 处理完成
    Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
end

== 阶段3: 任务启动和分发 ==

loop 事件轮询
    FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
    EventBus --> FireWorker: TaskStartLifecycleEvent
    
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
    note right of Handler: TaskStartLifecycleEventHandler\n初始化 TaskInstance
    
    Handler -> DB: insert(taskInstance)
    DB --> Handler: 返回 taskInstanceId
    
    Handler -> TaskAction: startEventAction(...)
    note right of TaskAction: TaskSubmittedStateAction
    
    TaskAction -> EventBus: publish(TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent)
    EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队
    
    TaskAction --> Handler: 处理完成
    Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
end

loop 事件轮询
    FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
    EventBus --> FireWorker: TaskDispatchLifecycleEvent
    
    FireWorker -> TaskAction: dispatchEventAction(...)
    
    TaskAction -> DB: updateById(taskInstance)\n状态: SUBMITTED_SUCCESS
    DB --> TaskAction: 更新成功
    
    TaskAction -> DispatchQueue: dispatchTaskExecuteRunnableWithDelay(...)
    DispatchQueue -> DispatchQueue: 任务入队
    
    TaskAction --> FireWorker: 处理完成
end

== 阶段4: 任务调度到Worker ==

loop DispatchLooper 持续运行
    DispatchQueue -> DispatchQueue: takeTaskExecuteRunnable()
    
    alt 状态为 SUBMITTED_SUCCESS
        DispatchQueue -> TaskClient: dispatch(taskRunnable)
        
        TaskClient -> TaskClient: 负载均衡选择 Worker
        
        TaskClient -> DB: updateById(taskInstance)\nhost = workerHost, 状态: DISPATCH
        DB --> TaskClient: 更新成功
        
        TaskClient -> Worker: dispatchTask(RPC调用)
        note right of Worker: IPhysicalTaskExecutorOperator\n.dispatchTask()
        
        Worker -> Worker: 创建线程执行任务
        
        Worker --> TaskClient: TaskExecutorDispatchResponse(success)
        TaskClient --> DispatchQueue: 分发成功
    end
end

== 阶段5: Worker执行和回调 ==

Worker -> Worker: 执行任务逻辑
Worker -> Worker: 任务执行完成

Worker -> EventBus: RPC回调\nonTaskExecutorSuccess()
note right of Worker: TaskExecutorEventListenerImpl\n发布 TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent

EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队

== 阶段6: 任务成功处理 ==

FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> FireWorker: TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent

FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
note right of Handler: TaskSuccessLifecycleEventHandler\n选择 TaskSuccessStateAction

Handler -> TaskAction: succeedEventAction(...)
note right of TaskAction: TaskSuccessStateAction

TaskAction -> DB: updateById(taskInstance)\n状态: SUCCESS, endTime, varPool
DB --> TaskAction: 更新成功

TaskAction -> TaskAction: mergeTaskVarPoolToWorkflow()
TaskAction -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队

TaskAction --> Handler: 处理完成
Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成

== 阶段7: 触发后续任务 ==

FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> FireWorker: WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent

FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
note right of Handler: WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionHandler\n选择 WorkflowRunningStateAction

Handler -> RunningAction: topologyLogicalTransitionEventAction(...)

RunningAction -> Graph: getSuccessors(taskRunnable)
Graph --> RunningAction: 后续任务列表

RunningAction -> Graph: isTriggerConditionMet(successors)
Graph --> RunningAction: true (前置任务已完成)

RunningAction -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队

note right of RunningAction: 回到阶段3，触发后续任务\n循环执行直到所有任务完成

RunningAction --> Handler: 处理完成
Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成

== 阶段8: 工作流完成 ==

note over RunningAction: 当所有任务都完成时

RunningAction -> Graph: isAllTaskExecutionRunnableChainFinish()?
Graph --> RunningAction: true

RunningAction -> Graph: isAllTaskExecutionRunnableChainSuccess()?
Graph --> RunningAction: true

RunningAction -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队

FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> FireWorker: WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent

FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
Handler -> RunningAction: succeedEventAction(...)

RunningAction -> DB: updateById(workflowInstance)\n状态: SUCCESS, endTime
DB --> RunningAction: 更新成功

RunningAction -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowFinalizeLifecycleEvent)
EventBus -> EventBus: 事件入队

RunningAction --> Handler: 工作流完成
Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成

== 总结 ==

note over Engine, DB
  **关键流程：**
  
  1. 事件驱动：所有状态转换通过事件触发
  2. 异步处理：事件发布后立即返回，后台处理
  3. 定时轮询：每100ms轮询一次事件队列
  4. 状态机：根据当前状态选择对应的 StateAction
  5. 链式触发：任务完成自动触发后续任务
  6. 循环执行：阶段3-7循环，直到所有任务完成
end note

@enduml
